  "releaseNotes": "V 1.5.9\n\t\t\t- DirectDebitPaymentRequestBulk mandate information improvements\n\t\t\tV 1.5.8\n\t\t\t- DirectDebitPaymentRequestBulk mandate information\n\t\t\tV 1.5.7\n\t\t\t- Added AccountBalanceResponse for get account balance endpoint. direct-debit payment product added\n\t\t\tV 1.5.6\n\t\t\t- Payment lines returned with paymentId in payment information\n\t\t\tV 1.5.5\n\t\t\t- Add models for DirectDebit payments\n\t\t\tV 1.5.4\n\t\t\t- Add models for mandates\n\t\t\tV 1.5.3\n\t\t\t- Entry details count on transaction response\n\t\t\tV 1.5.2\n\t\t\t- BundleReference on paymentlines for bundling together payments\n\t\t\tV 1.5.1\n\t\t\t- Default value for BatchBookingPreferred = true\n\t\t\tV 1.5.0\n\t\t\t- Remodeling of some types to match actual data\n\t\t\tV 1.4.0\n\t\t\t- Add headless query type\n\t\t\tV 1.3.6\n\t\t\t- CreditorAgentCountryCode added to PaymentLine\n\t\t\tV 1.3.5\n\t\t\t- Credit debit filter in transaction api\n\t\t\tV 1.3.4\n\t\t\t- All data in transactions can be set and not only init'ed\n\t\t\tV 1.3.3\n\t\t\t- Exchange rate, charges and amount details\n\t\t\tV 1.3.2\n\t\t\t- References, Creditor and Debtors in entry details. Old references marked as deprecated\n\t\t\tV 1.3.1\n\t\t\t- References, Creditor and Debtors. Old references marked as deprecated\n\t\t\tV 1.3.0\n\t\t\t- Remittances V2 and paymentreferences, old remittance properties marked as deprecated\n\t\t\tV 1.2.0\n\t\t\t- Add net9 support\n\t\t\tV 1.1.0\n\t\t\t- SubscriptionId and ResourceGroupName added to CreateConsentRequest.\n\t\t\t- ResourceId added to ConsentBase\n\t\t\tV 1.0.8\n\t\t\t- Transaction detailt contains additional transaction details\n\t\t\tV 1.0.7\n\t\t\t- InstructionId added to Transactions and TransactionsDetails\n\t\t\tV 1.0.6\n\t\t\t- Payment response wrapped to contain idempotency for post requests\n\t\t\tV 1.0.5\n\t\t\t- Status added to AccountResponse\n\t\t\tV 1.0.4\n\t\t\t- OwnerName added to AccountResponse\n\t\t\tV 1.0.3\n\t\t\t- Self link removed from Link type\n\t\t\tV 1.0.2\n\t\t\t- Path builder added for query and path creation\n\t\t\tV 1.0.1\n\t\t\t- Helpers added for creating paths and links for Accounts and transactions endpoints\n\t\t\tV 1.0.0\n\t\t\t- Initial release",
